OL,3,GNEWSAPat Karney: Tributes to political
OL,4,A'giant'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTributes have been paid to "a giant" of
OL,7,FManchester's political scene on his
OL,8,Fdeath at the age of 78.
OL,10,FPat Karney had represented Harpurhey
OL,11,Ffor Labour since 1979 and had been
OL,12,Fwell-known as the authority's city
OL,13,Fcentre spokesman.
OL,15,FHe had been suffering from cancer and
OL,16,Fhad been having treatment at The
OL,17,FChristie hospital.
